                                                "sense_id": "b5202868-86b6-3ae1-ab81-cb5fa933692f",
                                                "text": "Faster-than-light drives use element zero cores to reduce the mass of a ship, allowing higher rates of acceleration. This effectively raises the speed of light within the mass effect field, allowing high speed travel with negligible relativistic time dilation effects."
                                            }
